  "description": "kernelCAD is an agent-first CAD platform. Claude can generate and edit parametric 3D models, inspect geometry (dimensions, mass properties, cross-sections, interference checks), validate designs for 3D printing, and export production-ready STEP and STL files. Models stay fully editable: every dimension is a named parameter Claude can change on request. Includes assemblies with kinematic joints, rendering for visual review, and a web Studio where users can view and share the models Claude builds.",
